{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1772187754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras_big/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1772187754 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.poster.avif?t=1772187754\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.webm?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/ac85adbc94c2c10edf7d598a8d9f3f05.mp4?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Zodiac Trials, where aspiring animal spirits from across the realms compete for a divine seat among the stars. Face demons, Guardians, and your own limits to claim the title of the <strong>13th Zodiac</strong> in this <strong>roguelike hack-and-slash</strong> inspired by <strong>Eastern mythology</strong>. You are the plucky underdog fighting for celestial glory \u2014 forge powerful builds, conquer shifting arenas, and rise stronger after every fall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SELECT FROM  UNIQUE CHALLENGERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the Trials with a cast of extraordinary animal spirits, each mastering a distinct combat style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fox</strong> \u2013 A lightning-fast swordswoman whose strikes flash like thunder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raven</strong> \u2013 A graceful reaper who commands razor-sharp feathers from above.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to follow</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR REPLAYABILITY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.poster.avif?t=1772187754\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.webm?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/3f601392dfa8322d1caa32213ec41641.mp4?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a fresh climb toward greatness. Master diverse characters, craft your playstyle through <strong>deep upgrades and modifiers</strong>, and unlock new powers that change how every encounter unfolds. No two trials are ever the same \u2014 each victory and defeat reshapes your path through the celestial realms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR AS A TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Mode</strong> \u2013 Sharpen your skills in a single-player action roguelike experience built for fluid combat, precision, and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.poster.avif?t=1772187754\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.webm?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/86637aa858b6147f5fa0dbd0a16c382f.mp4?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Mode (2\u20134 Players)</strong> \u2013 Join forces with friends to face tougher enemies, stronger bosses, and even moral temptations that can test your teamwork and resolve.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.poster.avif?t=1772187754\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.webm?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.mp4?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHALLENGE FOR ALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re new to the genre or a seasoned action roguelike veteran, <strong>13Z: The Zodiac Trials</strong> offers a challenge that grows with you. Each run is a dance of grit, speed, and power against hordes of foes and cunning Guardians. Triumph through adaptability, clever builds, and relentless spirit \u2014 and you may yet carve your name among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.poster.avif?t=1772187754\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.webm?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.mp4?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials await the next legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seize the mantle and become the <strong>13th Zodiac Guardian</strong>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2348250?t=1772187754","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/f1f4e35cacec8556311dfe6c12329f69bb8df200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772187754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/e16bc4c3638e12077249997fd28e2320dac90249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772187754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/e16bc4c3638e12077249997fd28e2320dac90249/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772187754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3955140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/91568d97dc76ef3bf5e9b2e121a581b4.avif?t=1772187754\" width=1412 height=292 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1772187754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras_big/8328b51cff04ac5d540383ba47543b67.avif?t=1772187754 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=