team/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.poster.avif?t=1772187754\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.webm?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/a9e320fc794b2d5b0d2f1e2b69a6eda9.mp4?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CHALLENGE FOR ALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re new to the genre or a seasoned action roguelike veteran, <strong>13Z: The Zodiac Trials</strong> offers a challenge that grows with you. Each run is a dance of grit, speed, and power against hordes of foes and cunning Guardians. Triumph through adaptability, clever builds, and relentless spirit \u2014 and you may yet carve your name among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.poster.avif?t=1772187754\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.webm?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/extras/07e472203c068233e5ae89e29b35d343.mp4?t=1772187754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials await the next legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you seize the mantle and become the <strong>13th Zodiac Guardian</strong>?</p>","developers":["Mixed Realms Pte Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2348250/6d4647c5ddb9e1219947a24